        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Door Saver, Heavy Duty Hold Open Arm</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFits <a href=\"/products/commercial-ada-compliant-full-cover-surface-mount-closer-american-eagle-5100\"><b>American Eagle 5100 Door Closers</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-delayed-action-handicap-door-closer-american-eagle-5141-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 5141 Delayed Action Handicap Door Closer</b></a> (for 11 mm closer pinion shaft). \r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Parallel Arm Mount Only (door closer mounted on the push side of the door)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: For regular or top jamb mounting use <a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-5100-pdq-999002\"><b>PDQ 999002 Friction Hold Open Arm</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty rigid arm assembly and soffit plate with field reversible dead stop. Arm incorporates a thumb turn hold open function that can be set to active or in-active. The built in closer arm dead stop protects the closer, door and frame from damage when the door is swung open by the wind. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNon-handed for use or left or right hand doors. <b>(*fits 11 mm square closer shaft)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Available in 3 painted finishes of Aluminum, Dark Bronze or Gold and 2 plated finishes, Polished Brass or Satin Chrome.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Heavy Duty Hold Open Arm for American Eagle 5100",
                "description": "PDQ American Eagle 519016 - Door Saver, Heavy Duty Hold Open Arm for American Eagle 5100 door closers. Parallel Arm Mount Only (door closer mounted on the push side of the door).  Heavy duty rigid arm assembly and soffit plate with field reversible dead stop. Arm incorporates a thumb turn hold open function that can be set to active or in-active. The built in closer arm dead stop protects the closer, door and frame from damage when the door is swung open by the wind. Available in 3 painted finishes of Aluminum, Dark Bronze or Gold and 2 plated finishes, Polished Brass or Satin Chrome.",
